# playpick cell: mode=clear spec=druid:guardian style=good size=25
# difficulty=heroic view=820x1180,touch save=carried (behaves as fresh, #273 --
# carried save does not survive between playbot invocations since the port is
# PID-keyed, so #b=marrow&s=25&h=1 is used to unlock the chain up to 25-heroic
# the same way every other 25-heroic carried-cell script in this ledger does).
#
# Checked against sessions.jsonl first: druid:guardian has three mode=clear/
# mode=walk appearances (wander/10-normal, flee/10-normal, good/10-normal-walk)
# and none at 25-heroic; no mode=clear session has ever run good-style on a
# tank spec, and no clear-mode good-style evening exists at 25-heroic either
# (the two 25-heroic good evenings on record are shaman:elemental and a walk-
# mode paladin, neither a tank). [[#6]]'s pattern so far is that 10-normal
# evenings stall in THE VIGIL under every style tried while 25-heroic ones
# (idle, dodge) have crossed it clean -- this is the first chance to see
# whether a tank spec specifically, played well, still crosses it clean at
# this size/difficulty, and how far a tank's own survivability carries a
# good-style evening past the point [[#3]]'s zero-clean-25-heroic-evenings-to-
# the-second-boss record currently reaches (paladin:retribution/dodge got
# furthest: Bonegrinder killed clean, Last Whisper to 26%, five rooms).
open #b=marrow&s=25&h=1
tap back
tap raid
shot raid-setup
tap next
tap class:druid:guardian
shot class-selected
tap pull
waitscreen fight 15
state
shot start
targets
ui
evening good 220 10
shot end
state
says
bill
